zone:0:500:0:0:0:500:My house. This house is made of brick and topaz. This house is luxurious. The roof is topped with a statue of a coiling snake.
zone:0:50:0:0:0:500:The yard of a luxurious house. In this courtyard, there are brick benches where the servants of the owner of the house are sitting.
dialog:0:0:0:0:0:500:Hello=Welcome to my house!=I hope you will like this house. It is luxurious. There will be plenty for you to see.
