zone:14:28:0:0:0:500:A bench for the servants, so they can sit down and rest from their work.
tile:50:50:0:0:0:500:wallwood18
dialog:17:17:0:0:2:2:Hello, traveler!=My name is Luiz.=I am the maid of the owner of this luxurious house.=You go ahead, go. We want to rest. Soon we’ll have to get back to work again.
zone:17:17:0:0:2:2:On the bench sits an old woman in a dress made of the cheapest silk. She is obviously sad.:trackme
tile:17:17:0:0:2:2:carpet11
dialog:23:23:0:0:2:2:Traveler, I have no time for you, sorry.=My crazy dog doesn’t listen to me at all.=Krinzy! Come here! Riiiiiight next to me!
zone:17:17:0:0:2:2:A stout man is sitting on a bench and whistling into the distance.:trackme
